flowchart TD
    Start([Periodic Scheduler: Go Background Goroutine / Cron]) --> CekExpired{Cek Kunjungan 'requested' > 7 Hari?}
    CekExpired -- Ya --> AutoCancel[Update Status: cancelled & Log History]
    CekExpired -- Tidak --> CekOverstay
    
    CekOverstay{Cek Kunjungan 'visiting' > end_date + 24 Jam?}
    CekOverstay -- Ya --> AutoComplete[Update Status: completed & Flag Selesai Otomatis]
    CekOverstay -- Tidak --> Selesai([Selesai])
    
    AutoCancel --> Selesai
    AutoComplete --> Selesai